### Production Considerations
- **Memory Management**: Monitor cache sizes and implement eviction policies
- **Cache Warming**: Pre-populate caches for critical data
- **Performance Budget**: Set performance targets and monitor continuously
- **Resource Limits**: Respect system resources and implement backpressure
- **Monitoring**: Track performance metrics and set up alerts

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ No cache invalidation (leads to stale data)
- ❌ Infinite cache TTL (memory leaks)
- ❌ Blocking main thread with heavy computations
- ❌ Not respecting rate limits for external services
- ❌ Not monitoring performance metrics

